I do not know whether the reason is the same but I created a case that has a similar problem.

library(lavaan)
#> This is lavaan 0.6-15
#> lavaan is FREE software! Please report any bugs.
mod_pop <-
"
f1 =~ .7 * x1 + .7 * x2 + .7 * x3 + .7 * x4 + .7 * x5
"

dat <- simulateData(mod_pop, sample.nobs = 400, seed = 5415)
cov(dat)
#>           x1        x2        x3        x4        x5
